From: Mohamed Ashry <contact@atharapp.download>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 17:40:06 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 02/12] feat(desktop): add v3 hash router, V3App shell, and
 route placeholders

Implement client-side hash router with route matching and navigation.
Provide V3App shell with Client, Capabilities, I18n, Theme, Density,
and DataReady providers wrapping Frame. Add startup route decision logic
to route to onboarding only when incomplete, otherwise root. Wire ?ui=v3
and ui_version flag in main.tsx without changing v2 defaults.
